 assume it just hard stops.\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tget_tree().quit()\n\tprint('after quit')\n```\n\nThis can have all kinds of side effects:\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar a = 1\n\tget_tree().quit()\n\ta = 2\n\tprint('after quit')\n\tprint(a)\n```\nHere, `a` is sometimes set to `2` after quitting.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123802/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123802/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}